title Vinyl P2a: the sleep timer's end (a 15-minute timer with 2 s left): the music paused, the notice "Sleep timer ended. Paused." on now playing (480x320 and 320x480 at their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
# the 3.5-inch panel's 6.3 px/mm: ROW 44, the approved 480x320 layout's volume group and seek row 43 px (the owner's rule R-4)
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP 15
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP_LEFT 2

wait 3000
shot 01-now-sleep-ended
expect text "Sleep timer ended. Paused."
expect noquit
